@prefix hpc: <http://example.org/hpc#>
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

hpc:Job a owl:Class.
hpc:Resource a owl:Class.
hpc:Timeslice a owl:Class.
hpc:oversubscribe a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:schedulertimeslice a owl:DatatypeProperty.
hpc:Activebitmap a owl:Class.
hpc:Gangscheduler a owl:Class.
hpc:Timeslicerthread a owl:Class.
hpc:Jobqueue a owl:Class.
hpc:Suspendedjob a owl:Class.
hpc:Partition a owl:Class.

hpc:allocatedto a owl:ObjectProperty ;
